{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36352","headline":"叙龙瑞观胜异寄于尊师 · 方干","name":"叙龙瑞观胜异寄于尊师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"混元融结致功难，山下平湖湖上山。\n万倾涵虚寒潋灩，千寻耸翠秀孱颜。\n芰荷香入琴棊处，雷雨声离栋牖间。\n但有五云依鹤岭，曾无陆路向人寰。\n夜溪漱玉常堪听，仙树垂珠可要攀。\n若弃荣名便居此，自然浮浊不相关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}